sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as React CloudAudit
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant JWT as Bearer validation
  participant Flow as chat_workflow
  participant Cloud as CloudAgent and AWSAuditor
  participant Model as Configured model API
  participant AWS as AWS read-only APIs
  participant RAG as Local FAISS retrieval
  participant Comp as ComplianceAgent
  participant Senior as SeniorAgent
  participant DB as Assessment storage
  User->>UI: Select services, accept backend region, submit
  UI->>API: POST chat with JWT and prompt
  API->>JWT: Verify signature and required claims
  JWT-->>API: Authenticated subject
  API->>Flow: Run workflow
  Flow->>Cloud: run_audit
  Cloud->>Model: Request read-only tool selection
  Model-->>Cloud: Tool calls (untrusted)
  Cloud->>Cloud: Validate tool names and arguments
  loop Selected tools in order
    Cloud->>AWS: Read resource configuration
    AWS-->>Cloud: Evidence or access errors
  end
  Cloud-->>Flow: Typed report and severity counts
  Flow->>RAG: Query guidance
  RAG-->>Flow: Attributed passages
  Flow->>Comp: Report plus retrieved guidance
  Comp->>Model: Generate assessment
  Model-->>Comp: Compliance text
  Flow->>Senior: Report plus compliance text
  Note over Senior: Prompt-guided review without deterministic claim verifier
  Senior->>Model: Generate independent review
  Model-->>Senior: Review text
  Flow-->>API: Separate outputs and citations
  API->>DB: Persist report and reviews through ChatService
  API-->>UI: Completed response and assessment id
  UI-->>User: Workflow output and report link
